        "description": "The events: an array, or { items: [...] } (also { entries } / { result }). Each item: { id, kind, actor, actor_image?, verb, target, suffix?, text?, time, details?: [{ label, value }], note?, attachments?: [{ name, url, thumbnail? }], icon?, tone? }. The sentence reads \"<actor> <verb> <target> <suffix>\" with actor and target in bold; use text instead of verb/target for free text. time: \"YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm:ss\" (UTC, as ServiceNow stores it), ISO, or epoch ms — other text is shown as typed. Values may be Table-API cells { value, display_value }. Bind a Data Resource to it.",
        "fieldType": "json",
        "label": "Items",
        "name": "items",
        "typeMetadata": {
            "schema": {
                "additionalProperties": true,
                "properties": {},
                "type": "object"
            }
        },
        "valueType": "string"
    },
    {
        "defaultValue": {},
